// .markdownlint-cli2.jsonc - markdownlint-cli2 options: what the linter scopes in and out
//
// Rule configuration lives in .markdownlint.jsonc; this file defines scope. The repository's .gitignore files are
// the source of truth for exclusions, so worktrees/ is never linted, and the glob form scopes to ignore files
// inside the tree being linted, so a per-issue worktree lints identically to the repository root checkout.
//
// see: https://github.com/DavidAnson/markdownlint-cli2#markdownlint-cli2jsonc
{
  "gitignore": "**/.gitignore"
}
